sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant GW as FastAPI Gateway
    participant OCR as OCR Microservice
    participant CV as OpenCV Preprocessor
    participant YOLO as YOLOv8 Models
    participant MI as Mistral Large API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / MongoDB

    UI->>GW: POST /api/v1/extract-document<br/>multipart/form-data (image/PDF)
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT + RBAC<br/>Check file type + 10MB limit
    GW->>GW: Circuit breaker check
    GW->>OCR: Forward file upload

    OCR->>OCR: Save file to /uploads/
    OCR->>OCR: Validate file extension<br/>(png, jpg, pdf, bmp, tiff, webp)

    Note over OCR,CV: Image Preprocessing
    OCR->>CV: preprocess_image(filepath)
    CV->>CV: Grayscale conversion
    CV->>CV: Deskew (minAreaRect rotation)
    CV->>CV: Denoise (fastNlMeansDenoising)
    CV->>CV: Contrast (equalizeHist)
    CV->>CV: Upscale if < 1500px
    CV-->>OCR: processed_image_path

    Note over OCR,YOLO: Engine A: YOLO ID Detection
    OCR->>YOLO: detect_id_card(image, model_id_card)
    YOLO-->>OCR: id_card_bboxes[]

    alt National ID Detected
        OCR->>YOLO: process_image(image, model_id_card, model_job)
        YOLO->>YOLO: Detect subfields (name, ID, photo, etc.)
        YOLO->>YOLO: Crop + Tesseract OCR per field
        YOLO-->>OCR: {name, national_id, address, ...}
    else No ID Detected → Mistral Pipeline
        OCR->>MI: ocr_image(filepath)<br/>Generic text extraction
        MI-->>OCR: Raw markdown text

        OCR->>OCR: detect_doc_type(full_text)<br/>Keyword heuristic scoring

        alt Heuristic Confident
            OCR->>OCR: Use detected doc_type
        else Ambiguous
            OCR->>MI: LLM classification prompt
            MI-->>OCR: Detected doc_type
        end

        OCR->>MI: Re-OCR with doc-specific prompt<br/>(birth_cert / thanawiya / passport / transcript)
        MI-->>OCR: Enhanced structured text

        OCR->>MI: extract_structured(text, PROMPTS[doc_type])
        MI-->>OCR: JSON structured data
    end

    Note over OCR: Post-Processing
    OCR->>OCR: force_convert_numerals()<br/>Arabic → Western digits
    OCR->>OCR: JSON sanitization + validation

    OCR->>OCR: Cleanup uploaded files

    OCR-->>GW: {document_type, extracted_data,<br/>pages_processed}
    GW-->>UI: OCRResponse JSON
    UI->>UI: Render extracted fields<br/>+ auto-fill admission form